stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> INTAKE

    INTAKE: Step 1 - INTAKE (+outline confirmation)
    DRAFT_PLAN: Step 2 - DRAFT_PLAN (spec + plan + strategy)
    PLAN_REVIEW: Step 3 - PLAN_REVIEW (+adversarial audit)
    APPROVED: Step 4 - APPROVED (Gate 1 signed)
    IN_WORKTREE: Step 5 - IN_WORKTREE (isolated build)
    WORKTREE_REVIEW: Step 6 - WORKTREE_REVIEW (+code audit)
    VERIFY_EXIT: Step 7 - VERIFY_EXIT (Gate 3 signed + retrospective)
    DONE: Step 8 - DONE (signed closure)
    ROLLED_BACK: ROLLED_BACK
    ESCALATED: ESCALATED

    %% Forward path (7)
    INTAKE --> DRAFT_PLAN
    DRAFT_PLAN --> PLAN_REVIEW
    PLAN_REVIEW --> APPROVED
    APPROVED --> IN_WORKTREE
    IN_WORKTREE --> WORKTREE_REVIEW
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> VERIFY_EXIT
    VERIFY_EXIT --> DONE

    %% Revise loops (5; DRAFT_PLAN --> INTAKE also serves as Reset)
    PLAN_REVIEW --> DRAFT_PLAN
    DRAFT_PLAN --> INTAKE
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> IN_WORKTREE
    VERIFY_EXIT --> IN_WORKTREE
    VERIFY_EXIT --> WORKTREE_REVIEW

    %% Rollback paths (4)
    IN_WORKTREE --> ROLLED_BACK
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> ROLLED_BACK
    VERIFY_EXIT --> ROLLED_BACK
    ROLLED_BACK --> PLAN_REVIEW

    %% Escalate paths (3)
    INTAKE --> ESCALATED
    ROLLED_BACK --> ESCALATED
    ESCALATED --> PLAN_REVIEW

    %% Human-only Reset -> INTAKE (remaining 7)
    PLAN_REVIEW --> INTAKE
    APPROVED --> INTAKE
    IN_WORKTREE --> INTAKE
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> INTAKE
    VERIFY_EXIT --> INTAKE
    ROLLED_BACK --> INTAKE
    ESCALATED --> INTAKE

    %% Human-signed Force-close -> DONE (remaining 8)
    INTAKE --> DONE
    DRAFT_PLAN --> DONE
    PLAN_REVIEW --> DONE
    APPROVED --> DONE
    IN_WORKTREE --> DONE
    WORKTREE_REVIEW --> DONE
    ROLLED_BACK --> DONE
    ESCALATED --> DONE
